(3119737, 438583, 36065, '<td valign="top">It is sky, and it does hold a certain interest.  I think that is needs a bit more to really hold the viewer.</td>', 'It is sky, and it does hold a certain interest.  I think that is needs a bit more to really hold the viewer.', '2006-12-15 03:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119738, 437730, 36065, '<td valign="top">I really like this minimalistic feel.  This is my second favorite of the challenge, and I hope it does very well.  My only critique is the bird on the far left.  It looks like a dust spec on my monitors, and I might have considered cloning that one out.</td>', 'I really like this minimalistic feel.  This is my second favorite of the challenge, and I hope it does very well.  My only critique is the bird on the far left.  It looks like a dust spec on my monitors, and I might have considered cloning that one out.', '2006-12-15 03:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119739, 437270, 36065, '<td valign="top">Bear?  Either way, this is the best of the challenge.  Very nice work in using the rule set, yet still preserving the integrity of the image and photography.  This has to be a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Bear?  Either way, this is the best of the challenge.  Very nice work in using the rule set, yet still preserving the integrity of the image and photography.  This has to be a ribbon winner.', '2006-12-15 03:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119741, 438634, 36065, '<td valign="top">I think a bit more post-processing would have help this one.  I think the cloud and sky are marvelous, but I''d like to see more detail in the foreground.  I know, I know, it IS a sky challenge.  I''d still like a little more foreground detail.</td>', 'I think a bit more post-processing would have help this one.  I think the cloud and sky are marvelous, but I''d like to see more detail in the foreground.  I know, I know, it IS a sky challenge.  I''d still like a little more foreground detail.', '2006-12-15 03:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3119835, 438545, 65886, '<td valign="top">this is absolutely stunning, would love to know how you did it! amazing, and the idea, not just dramatic but ordinary sunsets.</td>', 'this is absolutely stunning, would love to know how you did it! amazing, and the idea, not just dramatic but ordinary sunsets.', '2006-12-15 05:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
