(3120587, 436271, 67152, '<td valign="top">There just appears to be too much going on in this photo for my taste.  I like the face, I like the hands, but the whole thing together doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'There just appears to be too much going on in this photo for my taste.  I like the face, I like the hands, but the whole thing together doesn''t work for me.', '2006-12-15 11:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
