(3120591, 438691, 38706, '<td valign="top">I like the effect but the lights on the car coming towards you just does not work for me.  I think the red trails from the cars away from you is probably fine but a little distracting also.</td>', 'I like the effect but the lights on the car coming towards you just does not work for me.  I think the red trails from the cars away from you is probably fine but a little distracting also.', '2006-12-15 11:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3120593, 437571, 38706, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I think it would work better with the kid off centre one way or the other but still nicely balanced.</td>', 'Great capture.  I think it would work better with the kid off centre one way or the other but still nicely balanced.', '2006-12-15 11:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3120594, 437220, 67152, '<td valign="top">Great composition - The thing that bothers me is that the birds are really sharp in focus and don''t see to be moving, but the windmill appears to be rotating really fast.  Therefore it really looks like two images rather than one.  Getting the birds with the sky and not having the windmill in the background would have raised my scoring considerably</td>', 'Great composition - The thing that bothers me is that the birds are really sharp in focus and don''t see to be moving, but the windmill appears to be rotating really fast.  Therefore it really looks like two images rather than one.  Getting the birds with the sky and not having the windmill in the background would have raised my scoring considerably', '2006-12-15 11:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3120597, 438348, 11960, '<td valign="top">Since we have free range, I would have cloned/healed out the lights on the building on the right... They distract from the overall image.</td>', 'Since we have free range, I would have cloned/healed out the lights on the building on the right... They distract from the overall image.', '2006-12-15 11:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
