(3121228, 438757, 62095, '<td valign="top">Clearly this is an excellent image.  The elements all combine well, it has a very good "feel" to it. The one issue that I have with it is that it is very much in the realm of art rather than photo.  So I can''t give it a 10, but it''s good.</td>', 'Clearly this is an excellent image.  The elements all combine well, it has a very good "feel" to it. The one issue that I have with it is that it is very much in the realm of art rather than photo.  So I can''t give it a 10, but it''s good.', '2006-12-15 15:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
