(3121673, 438731, 53316, '<td valign="top">Well... I am trying to be open minded here, but this does not really say "sky" to me.  I like the concept... just there''s nothing to tell me this isn''t just water.  Maybe if it were blue instead of black and white - the sky would still blend into the water but at least there would be more for my mind to say "oh that is sky".  <br/> <br/>In my mind, I totally get what you''re going for, and I love the concept and the creativity here - but at the same time, my eye does not see anything like sky (as I said, I really think blue would have helped).  Because of the dual way I''m looking at this, I am not going to give you a low, DNMC score, but I think I will not score it as high as I would have in, say, a free study.</td>', 'Well... I am trying to be open minded here, but this does not really say "sky" to me.  I like the concept... just there''s nothing to tell me this isn''t just water.  Maybe if it were blue instead of black and white - the sky would still blend into the water but at least there would be more for my mind to say "oh that is sky".   In my mind, I totally get what you''re going for, and I love the concept and the creativity here - but at the same time, my eye does not see anything like sky (as I said, I really think blue would have helped).  Because of the dual way I''m looking at this, I am not going to give you a low, DNMC score, but I think I will not score it as high as I would have in, say, a free study.', '2006-12-15 17:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3121678, 436420, 52130, '<td valign="top">there is actually an absence of sky here. It doesn''t quite meet the challenge for me, plus with the expert editing, you could have added a sky to this. 4</td>', 'there is actually an absence of sky here. It doesn''t quite meet the challenge for me, plus with the expert editing, you could have added a sky to this. 4', '2006-12-15 17:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
