(3121845, 437571, 48588, '<td valign="top">This would''ve been just uber-cute without the dramatic background.  With the pier &amp; sphere case by the sun, this got even better.  Great job!<br/> <br/>The flowers in her hair are a nice touch.</td>', 'This would''ve been just uber-cute without the dramatic background.  With the pier & sphere case by the sun, this got even better.  Great job! The flowers in her hair are a nice touch.', '2006-12-15 18:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
