(3121939, 438545, 43565, '<td valign="top">To me, this is more digital art than photography.  While I love it and would give it a 10 in a digital art contest, I think the intent of the rules is to have the result still look like a photo.  For that reason, my final score is an 8.</td>', 'To me, this is more digital art than photography.  While I love it and would give it a 10 in a digital art contest, I think the intent of the rules is to have the result still look like a photo.  For that reason, my final score is an 8.', '2006-12-15 18:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
