(3122560, 438768, 67841, '<td valign="top">See, that''s what suck about ''Expert Editing'' - you''re left questioning whether someone has expertly captured a moment or expertly crafted one.  This would be easy to score in ''Advanced"...<br/> <br/>I was born &amp; raised in the far north of rural Michigan &amp; I''ve seen nights like this before.  If this was photoshop you deserve a 9 &amp; if this was a capture then you deserve an 11 so I''ll just give you the average of those two..<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 10 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'See, that''s what suck about ''Expert Editing'' - you''re left questioning whether someone has expertly captured a moment or expertly crafted one.  This would be easy to score in ''Advanced"... I was born & raised in the far north of rural Michigan & I''ve seen nights like this before.  If this was photoshop you deserve a 9 & if this was a capture then you deserve an 11 so I''ll just give you the average of those two.. << 10 >>', '2006-12-15 23:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
