(3122859, 438571, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wowsers! This is really, really creepy. (in this case, that is a good thing) Really freakin'' me out :-) Very cool processing, looks like a drawing. Wow. Just really ...creepy and freaky! Cool. The teddy bear is really adding to the creepiness. Cool, way, way cool. I am totally freaked out, but I like it. Nice job!</td>', 'Wowsers! This is really, really creepy. (in this case, that is a good thing) Really freakin'' me out :-) Very cool processing, looks like a drawing. Wow. Just really ...creepy and freaky! Cool. The teddy bear is really adding to the creepiness. Cool, way, way cool. I am totally freaked out, but I like it. Nice job!', '2006-12-16 05:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
