(3122872, 438812, 19831, '<td valign="top">Those look like they might be really nice shots of the cars. IMO, doing the warp thing to them isn''t very appealing. Also, the sky background is very dull, the cars don''t look very good against it, IMO. I understand the concept you''re going for, I think it is a good one, a nice idea, very cool. It just doesn''t seem to all come together in this case.</td>', 'Those look like they might be really nice shots of the cars. IMO, doing the warp thing to them isn''t very appealing. Also, the sky background is very dull, the cars don''t look very good against it, IMO. I understand the concept you''re going for, I think it is a good one, a nice idea, very cool. It just doesn''t seem to all come together in this case.', '2006-12-16 05:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122880, 438693, 57229, '<td valign="top">I predict success for this Magritte-esque bit of surrealism. The photoshopping and even the phtography are (deceptively?) simple, there''s no clutter and the whole thing is - er - comprehensible, all of which goes down well at dpc. Deserves it, too - eight from me.</td>', 'I predict success for this Magritte-esque bit of surrealism. The photoshopping and even the phtography are (deceptively?) simple, there''s no clutter and the whole thing is - er - comprehensible, all of which goes down well at dpc. Deserves it, too - eight from me.', '2006-12-16 05:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122883, 437566, 57229, '<td valign="top">Multi-shot panorama? Very well done. 7</td>', 'Multi-shot panorama? Very well done. 7', '2006-12-16 05:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122892, 438734, 57229, '<td valign="top">This may be hampered by being 600 pixels. Big sky needs big formats. Maybe. Not alot you can do about that in the context of dpc challenges, but it just occurred to me, so... The saturation/desaturation seems like a good idea, but I''m not sure you''ve succeeded with it.</td>', 'This may be hampered by being 600 pixels. Big sky needs big formats. Maybe. Not alot you can do about that in the context of dpc challenges, but it just occurred to me, so... The saturation/desaturation seems like a good idea, but I''m not sure you''ve succeeded with it.', '2006-12-16 05:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3122896, 438522, 57229, '<td valign="top">Excellent mood comoing out of this - just a teeny bit like being there.</td>', 'Excellent mood comoing out of this - just a teeny bit like being there.', '2006-12-16 05:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
