(3123364, 438761, 327, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors and light. Really nice. Good-luck!</td>', 'Stunning colors and light. Really nice. Good-luck!', '2006-12-16 10:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123366, 438757, 327, '<td valign="top">Cool work. I love the b&amp;w for this. Nice entry, good luck.</td>', 'Cool work. I love the b&w for this. Nice entry, good luck.', '2006-12-16 10:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123399, 437455, 62671, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the oranges and blues is nice. Horizon is slightly off kilter and in the center of the frame.   Sky is the subject it should have the upper 3rd of the image.  The fire is competeing for dominance in this shot. A good job on a difficult shot as the camera would want to either meter at the fire or the sky.  A spot in the upper left part of the sky is attracting my eye.   It would have been cool to get lower and have the embers flying across the all sunset sky.</td>', 'The contrast of the oranges and blues is nice. Horizon is slightly off kilter and in the center of the frame.   Sky is the subject it should have the upper 3rd of the image.  The fire is competeing for dominance in this shot. A good job on a difficult shot as the camera would want to either meter at the fire or the sky.  A spot in the upper left part of the sky is attracting my eye.   It would have been cool to get lower and have the embers flying across the all sunset sky.', '2006-12-16 11:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123403, 438136, 62671, '<td valign="top">This is very creative and well thought out.  The red shorts contrasts against the blue nicely.</td>', 'This is very creative and well thought out.  The red shorts contrasts against the blue nicely.', '2006-12-16 11:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123422, 438795, 62671, '<td valign="top">Looking thru the eye in Mordor!  Its grey and gloomy.  I would love to see some deep blues mixed in.</td>', 'Looking thru the eye in Mordor!  Its grey and gloomy.  I would love to see some deep blues mixed in.', '2006-12-16 11:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123424, 438545, 18191, '<td valign="top">This reminds me a lof of The Little Prince by St. Exupery!</td>', 'This reminds me a lof of The Little Prince by St. Exupery!', '2006-12-16 11:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123425, 436459, 62671, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture,  but the subject is not the sky.</td>', 'Very interesting picture,  but the subject is not the sky.', '2006-12-16 11:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123427, 437408, 62671, '<td valign="top">The color tones are nice here.  You could have lowered the horizon and included the tops of the tree for a better composition.</td>', 'The color tones are nice here.  You could have lowered the horizon and included the tops of the tree for a better composition.', '2006-12-16 11:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123431, 438522, 62671, '<td valign="top">A very difficult shot done well.  I would have waited for the sun to crest the horizon a tad more so it doesnt fill quite as much space with blinding white.   Love the star burst  and framing of this shot.</td>', 'A very difficult shot done well.  I would have waited for the sun to crest the horizon a tad more so it doesnt fill quite as much space with blinding white.   Love the star burst  and framing of this shot.', '2006-12-16 11:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123433, 438571, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful processing and wonderful piece -- great stuff!</td>', 'Beautiful processing and wonderful piece -- great stuff!', '2006-12-16 11:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123434, 437730, 62671, '<td valign="top">This one is interesting  to look at.  I would have liked the birds to be larger on the frame.  The dot on the left side should have been cloned out.  The mountain peak really sets the scene for me.</td>', 'This one is interesting  to look at.  I would have liked the birds to be larger on the frame.  The dot on the left side should have been cloned out.  The mountain peak really sets the scene for me.', '2006-12-16 11:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123436, 438377, 62671, '<td valign="top">It appears the forest is being consumed by fire!  You could have set a firemans badge near it to enforce the feel.  but This is very nice done.</td>', 'It appears the forest is being consumed by fire!  You could have set a firemans badge near it to enforce the feel.  but This is very nice done.', '2006-12-16 11:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123437, 437383, 62671, '<td valign="top">I like the backlighting here.</td>', 'I like the backlighting here.', '2006-12-16 11:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123443, 438149, 62671, '<td valign="top">Very creative and unique.  The vertical lines in the orange tones below the building ruin the ''sky'' feel for me.  A good attempt.  Being an ex-architectural drafter, I see the perspective issue of the doors would be falling off the edge beyond. Not many would see that or take the time to feel it out.   I really like the guy in the shot as it gives it scale.   I really like the sky piece in the upper part.</td>', 'Very creative and unique.  The vertical lines in the orange tones below the building ruin the ''sky'' feel for me.  A good attempt.  Being an ex-architectural drafter, I see the perspective issue of the doors would be falling off the edge beyond. Not many would see that or take the time to feel it out.   I really like the guy in the shot as it gives it scale.   I really like the sky piece in the upper part.', '2006-12-16 11:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123458, 438342, 62671, '<td valign="top">The sky is pretty but its not much of a subject.  It would be good for a texture or a replacement sky.</td>', 'The sky is pretty but its not much of a subject.  It would be good for a texture or a replacement sky.', '2006-12-16 12:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123459, 438532, 62671, '<td valign="top">if the white spot is supposed to be a star, there should be more of them.  Just the one needs to be removed for the sake of the image.  The tower of blue light is really cool!  Good composition.</td>', 'if the white spot is supposed to be a star, there should be more of them.  Just the one needs to be removed for the sake of the image.  The tower of blue light is really cool!  Good composition.', '2006-12-16 12:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123461, 438709, 62671, '<td valign="top">I love the raking light on the mountain.  This image has good color, contrast and depth.  The moon could have better placement and enlarged. Spectaclular scene.</td>', 'I love the raking light on the mountain.  This image has good color, contrast and depth.  The moon could have better placement and enlarged. Spectaclular scene.', '2006-12-16 12:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123464, 437349, 62671, '<td valign="top">great superman effect.</td>', 'great superman effect.', '2006-12-16 12:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123471, 438332, 62671, '<td valign="top">The horizon feels a tad tilted.  The action is on the ground and becomes the subject.   There isn''t much going on in the sky so there shouldn''t be that much of it there.  A center horizon would have worked here.  (one of the very few times I would use that composition)</td>', 'The horizon feels a tad tilted.  The action is on the ground and becomes the subject.   There isn''t much going on in the sky so there shouldn''t be that much of it there.  A center horizon would have worked here.  (one of the very few times I would use that composition)', '2006-12-16 12:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123477, 438840, 62671, '<td valign="top">A potentially good shot.  Its color and contrast is bland.   I''m also not crazy about the black viniette on the right side.  Composition  and the low amount of noise for this image is good.</td>', 'A potentially good shot.  Its color and contrast is bland.   I''m also not crazy about the black viniette on the right side.  Composition  and the low amount of noise for this image is good.', '2006-12-16 12:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123483, 437022, 62671, '<td valign="top">A very nice sky, Great color and textures.  I like the sunburst and the silhouettes.  I think a tad more ground could balance it out a bit better but the first shot I have seen where the subject (sky) actually dominates the scene as it should be!  Great job!</td>', 'A very nice sky, Great color and textures.  I like the sunburst and the silhouettes.  I think a tad more ground could balance it out a bit better but the first shot I have seen where the subject (sky) actually dominates the scene as it should be!  Great job!', '2006-12-16 12:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123490, 438670, 62671, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  I love the church with the red door and the fence that cuts all the way across very straight. The open gate is inviting the viewer to enter.  The color cast on the image doesn''t look quite right.  The blue in the back looks odd.  Also there are some white splotches in the sky around the steeple that distracts and doesn''t feel like they belong.  I really like the droopy big tree.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  I love the church with the red door and the fence that cuts all the way across very straight. The open gate is inviting the viewer to enter.  The color cast on the image doesn''t look quite right.  The blue in the back looks odd.  Also there are some white splotches in the sky around the steeple that distracts and doesn''t feel like they belong.  I really like the droopy big tree.', '2006-12-16 12:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123495, 438572, 62671, '<td valign="top">One monitor shows this incredibly noisey and the other monitor shows it incredibly dark.   There is very little sky in the shot and its cut in half. But it is the only thing you can really see well in either pic. A difficult shot indeed.  A neutral density filter might have helped but I think it would have caused problems with the window framing.  On the dark version the light post grabs your eye.  On the noisey version its not as dominating.  I would have liked to see more of the snowy scene lit well or more of the sky and less ground outside the window.</td>', 'One monitor shows this incredibly noisey and the other monitor shows it incredibly dark.   There is very little sky in the shot and its cut in half. But it is the only thing you can really see well in either pic. A difficult shot indeed.  A neutral density filter might have helped but I think it would have caused problems with the window framing.  On the dark version the light post grabs your eye.  On the noisey version its not as dominating.  I would have liked to see more of the snowy scene lit well or more of the sky and less ground outside the window.', '2006-12-16 12:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123501, 438791, 62671, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Knock my socks off!   I am so fascinated by lightning and yet Im so scared of it.  I love to look at the winding trails. Especially that large fat one that loops like a lariat.   The colors here are amazing and the reflection on the water just astounding.  Talk about the right place at the right time!   This is definately my 10!</td>', 'Wow!  Knock my socks off!   I am so fascinated by lightning and yet Im so scared of it.  I love to look at the winding trails. Especially that large fat one that loops like a lariat.   The colors here are amazing and the reflection on the water just astounding.  Talk about the right place at the right time!   This is definately my 10!', '2006-12-16 12:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123508, 436479, 62671, '<td valign="top">Very nice sky!  I might have added a touch of navy tone gradient to just the upper edge.  The orange reds are spectacular.  I''m glad you waited for the sun to go just below the horizon. We know its there and its not blinding us. Nice!</td>', 'Very nice sky!  I might have added a touch of navy tone gradient to just the upper edge.  The orange reds are spectacular.  I''m glad you waited for the sun to go just below the horizon. We know its there and its not blinding us. Nice!', '2006-12-16 12:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123511, 438634, 45790, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the clouds, but I would have liked to see the foreground as well (or maybe just crop it out?)</td>', 'Great shot of the clouds, but I would have liked to see the foreground as well (or maybe just crop it out?)', '2006-12-16 12:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123512, 438582, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good color but seems blurred.</td>', 'Good color but seems blurred.', '2006-12-16 12:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123514, 436009, 45790, '<td valign="top">Nice job! Creates a good 3D effect.</td>', 'Nice job! Creates a good 3D effect.', '2006-12-16 12:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123524, 438849, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good effect but fish is blurry and water murky.</td>', 'Good effect but fish is blurry and water murky.', '2006-12-16 12:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123526, 436479, 45790, '<td valign="top">Great color and detail. Well done!</td>', 'Great color and detail. Well done!', '2006-12-16 12:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123531, 438571, 45790, '<td valign="top">Stunning portrait shot at a very unusual angle -- it does make me a little uneasy as it appears like she is falling backwards.</td>', 'Stunning portrait shot at a very unusual angle -- it does make me a little uneasy as it appears like she is falling backwards.', '2006-12-16 12:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123536, 438825, 45790, '<td valign="top">Too much of this appears out of focus. Halo around wreath looks like this is an HDR, but if so you needed at least one additional exposure to bring out the interior of the house.</td>', 'Too much of this appears out of focus. Halo around wreath looks like this is an HDR, but if so you needed at least one additional exposure to bring out the interior of the house.', '2006-12-16 12:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123539, 438824, 45790, '<td valign="top">The scale of the moon makes this entirely surreal.</td>', 'The scale of the moon makes this entirely surreal.', '2006-12-16 12:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123541, 437393, 62671, '<td valign="top">sky is not the subject here.  It makes good contrast for your subject and the lighting.  Looks like there is a bit of fisheye distortion.  It adds to the surreal feeling of the shot.  Lighting is good but not natural looking a bit to harsh for me.  subject is in good focus and composition is good for a skateboarding action shot.</td>', 'sky is not the subject here.  It makes good contrast for your subject and the lighting.  Looks like there is a bit of fisheye distortion.  It adds to the surreal feeling of the shot.  Lighting is good but not natural looking a bit to harsh for me.  subject is in good focus and composition is good for a skateboarding action shot.', '2006-12-16 12:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123545, 437727, 62671, '<td valign="top">Looks like one of my grandmothers slides that I have been working on.  The deep gradient in the sky is nice with the poofy clouds breaking it up.  The sepia is a bit dark for me.  but it has nice contrast.   Definately fits the challenge theme and it is lovely.</td>', 'Looks like one of my grandmothers slides that I have been working on.  The deep gradient in the sky is nice with the poofy clouds breaking it up.  The sepia is a bit dark for me.  but it has nice contrast.   Definately fits the challenge theme and it is lovely.', '2006-12-16 12:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123549, 438024, 45790, '<td valign="top">Contrasting colors here make it really stand out.</td>', 'Contrasting colors here make it really stand out.', '2006-12-16 13:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123552, 436482, 45790, '<td valign="top">Clouds and use of B&amp;W are interesting, but the city is virtually invisible at this resolution.</td>', 'Clouds and use of B&W are interesting, but the city is virtually invisible at this resolution.', '2006-12-16 13:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123557, 436790, 45790, '<td valign="top">Nice find. I also like the framing.</td>', 'Nice find. I also like the framing.', '2006-12-16 13:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123561, 437352, 45790, '<td valign="top">That sky is great, but the parking lot is not.</td>', 'That sky is great, but the parking lot is not.', '2006-12-16 13:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123571, 438849, 62671, '<td valign="top">Im not crazy about this shot.  The concept here is not bad.  Its definately out of the box type of shot that I tend to attempt with varied results. <br/>The water is murky, the fish is out of focus, the eye is not clear, the overlay of the city doesnt fit the shape of the eye.  I would try this again as you have a good idea brewing, just a little more time and effor could produce something really good.</td>', 'Im not crazy about this shot.  The concept here is not bad.  Its definately out of the box type of shot that I tend to attempt with varied results. The water is murky, the fish is out of focus, the eye is not clear, the overlay of the city doesnt fit the shape of the eye.  I would try this again as you have a good idea brewing, just a little more time and effor could produce something really good.', '2006-12-16 13:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123572, 438504, 62671, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  The sky dominates the image like it should. Good color and composition.  A touch of noise in the darker tones.</td>', 'This is very nice.  The sky dominates the image like it should. Good color and composition.  A touch of noise in the darker tones.', '2006-12-16 13:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123574, 438474, 38032, '<td valign="top">Definitely an image that leaves an impression on the viewer - the feeling and color is great. It''s strange that the reflection looks obvious for the trees but not the sky.  Perhaps this is intentional. The clouds in the sky are particularly stunning.</td>', 'Definitely an image that leaves an impression on the viewer - the feeling and color is great. It''s strange that the reflection looks obvious for the trees but not the sky.  Perhaps this is intentional. The clouds in the sky are particularly stunning.', '2006-12-16 13:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123577, 436420, 38032, '<td valign="top">This image has a great feeling to it.  The composition is fantastic.</td>', 'This image has a great feeling to it.  The composition is fantastic.', '2006-12-16 13:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123578, 437220, 62671, '<td valign="top">The image would have been great without the windmill but its so huge that you couldn''t get away from it and get both the gulls and the sunset/rise.  I would have preferred it wasn''t in the center of the coposition.  The light and focus on the gulls is fantastic.  Good stop action shot.   However, they are the subject.  The sky is just a backdrop.</td>', 'The image would have been great without the windmill but its so huge that you couldn''t get away from it and get both the gulls and the sunset/rise.  I would have preferred it wasn''t in the center of the coposition.  The light and focus on the gulls is fantastic.  Good stop action shot.   However, they are the subject.  The sky is just a backdrop.', '2006-12-16 13:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123582, 437571, 62671, '<td valign="top">Very cute picture of a girl in the water.  Sky is not the subject here even though it is a lovely orange.  The Pier has a lovely pattern and would have also been good without the girl.   The girl is to centered though I see why it is done this way.   Good job on filling the front of her with light.  I like the reflection of the ripples.</td>', 'Very cute picture of a girl in the water.  Sky is not the subject here even though it is a lovely orange.  The Pier has a lovely pattern and would have also been good without the girl.   The girl is to centered though I see why it is done this way.   Good job on filling the front of her with light.  I like the reflection of the ripples.', '2006-12-16 13:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123584, 438413, 62671, '<td valign="top">That sky really looks like fire!  The silhouette of the tree is nice foreground for it.</td>', 'That sky really looks like fire!  The silhouette of the tree is nice foreground for it.', '2006-12-16 13:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123591, 436271, 62671, '<td valign="top">The fairy in the hands is so cute!  I love the variety of feathers.  The pose and expression are fantastic.  The blue sky is a good contrast to the orange feathers.  I don''t think I would have included the face in the sky.  But it does bring your attention back to the sky. However, I still feel the subject in this case is the fairy.  Not the sky.  Very creative and OOTB.</td>', 'The fairy in the hands is so cute!  I love the variety of feathers.  The pose and expression are fantastic.  The blue sky is a good contrast to the orange feathers.  I don''t think I would have included the face in the sky.  But it does bring your attention back to the sky. However, I still feel the subject in this case is the fairy.  Not the sky.  Very creative and OOTB.', '2006-12-16 13:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123592, 437199, 62671, '<td valign="top">Colors are nice, but the subject is bland.</td>', 'Colors are nice, but the subject is bland.', '2006-12-16 13:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123594, 437120, 62671, '<td valign="top">Not fond of this shot.  Sky should be the subject.</td>', 'Not fond of this shot.  Sky should be the subject.', '2006-12-16 13:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123595, 437786, 62671, '<td valign="top">There is a halo around the person. Maybe compression issue.</td>', 'There is a halo around the person. Maybe compression issue.', '2006-12-16 13:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123598, 436164, 62671, '<td valign="top">interesting addition.  Imo, should have been higher in the sky.</td>', 'interesting addition.  Imo, should have been higher in the sky.', '2006-12-16 13:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123600, 438703, 62671, '<td valign="top">I try not to put more than one 10 in a challenge... Looks like I will have to add another one here!  AMAZING!</td>', 'I try not to put more than one 10 in a challenge... Looks like I will have to add another one here!  AMAZING!', '2006-12-16 13:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123620, 436913, 4517, '<td valign="top">:)</td>', ':)', '2006-12-16 14:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123656, 438571, 327, '<td valign="top">I''ve bumped my vote on this one. I''ve found that I''m really drawn to this unusual photo. The color with the contrast of the white and of course the totally awesome perspective make this a good/good/good shot!!!</td>', 'I''ve bumped my vote on this one. I''ve found that I''m really drawn to this unusual photo. The color with the contrast of the white and of course the totally awesome perspective make this a good/good/good shot!!!', '2006-12-16 14:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123701, 437376, 61368, '<td valign="top">10! 10! 10! 10! 10!</td>', '10! 10! 10! 10! 10!', '2006-12-16 14:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
