(3123713, 438791, 47316, '<td valign="top">Wow great shot! Love the low moon and the reflections.</td>', 'Wow great shot! Love the low moon and the reflections.', '2006-12-16 15:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123717, 436459, 47316, '<td valign="top">Great editing! My only problem with this is that the sky in not prominent in the photo. It seems more like a wonderful setup on a blank background. Some nice dramatic clouds would have been wonderful but I''m sure would have caused some editing problems.</td>', 'Great editing! My only problem with this is that the sky in not prominent in the photo. It seems more like a wonderful setup on a blank background. Some nice dramatic clouds would have been wonderful but I''m sure would have caused some editing problems.', '2006-12-16 15:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
