(3123814, 438703, 327, '<td valign="top">great to see this and so fun to look at-fantastic work.</td>', 'great to see this and so fun to look at-fantastic work.', '2006-12-16 16:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123815, 437349, 327, '<td valign="top">SuperMAN in leather. lol Good job, good work, good entry.</td>', 'SuperMAN in leather. lol Good job, good work, good entry.', '2006-12-16 16:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123831, 438703, 32968, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot but the curve of the Earth is on a slant. Would''ve been ten.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot but the curve of the Earth is on a slant. Would''ve been ten.', '2006-12-16 16:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123835, 436692, 32968, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Suits the challenge very well in that the building is the subject, but the sky actually becomes the focus of the shot. Beautiful colors, crispy focus with some softness here and there. Looks like HDR</td>', 'Awesome. Suits the challenge very well in that the building is the subject, but the sky actually becomes the focus of the shot. Beautiful colors, crispy focus with some softness here and there. Looks like HDR', '2006-12-16 16:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123838, 438703, 25355, '<td valign="top">The water horizon looks curved; I guess it''s very wide angle lens which produces that aberration . It might have been cooler if it was even curvier.<br/>   I''m guessing this is Larus; definitely an Icelander</td>', 'The water horizon looks curved; I guess it''s very wide angle lens which produces that aberration . It might have been cooler if it was even curvier.   I''m guessing this is Larus; definitely an Icelander', '2006-12-16 16:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123840, 438583, 32968, '<td valign="top">Great caption :)</td>', 'Great caption :)', '2006-12-16 16:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123841, 437220, 32968, '<td valign="top">Love the focus. Wow! It has a 3D effect. Great colors and depth. Iput it in the ten pile :)</td>', 'Love the focus. Wow! It has a 3D effect. Great colors and depth. Iput it in the ten pile :)', '2006-12-16 16:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123850, 438824, 32968, '<td valign="top">I guess you could say the sky has an effect in this one (sarcasm) Wow! Nice shot. Great colors and focus. Loads of details. Perhaps a bit longer crop to include a bit more of the city but none the less, an awseome pic. Into the ten pile with it :)</td>', 'I guess you could say the sky has an effect in this one (sarcasm) Wow! Nice shot. Great colors and focus. Loads of details. Perhaps a bit longer crop to include a bit more of the city but none the less, an awseome pic. Into the ten pile with it :)', '2006-12-16 16:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123856, 437270, 25355, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''re on a roll, Bear.</td>', 'Looks like you''re on a roll, Bear.', '2006-12-16 16:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123857, 438849, 32968, '<td valign="top">Nice caption :) This would be perfect for a "Reflection" challenge. The sky doesn''t have a whole lot to do with the pic but I''m giving it an 8 because of the creativity employed :) This image should be used in photgraphy advertising.</td>', 'Nice caption :) This would be perfect for a "Reflection" challenge. The sky doesn''t have a whole lot to do with the pic but I''m giving it an 8 because of the creativity employed :) This image should be used in photgraphy advertising.', '2006-12-16 16:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123858, 436619, 32968, '<td valign="top">"Oh wow!" Sorry, that''s all I can say :) That, and "gorgeous"!</td>', '"Oh wow!" Sorry, that''s all I can say :) That, and "gorgeous"!', '2006-12-16 16:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123871, 438768, 32968, '<td valign="top">Another in the "Oh Wow!" category :) Beautiful shot. I''m a huge Northern Lights fan. There isn''t much that''s more awe-inspiring than the display they create. You''ve managed to captured an incredible show here. I have to ask if you''ve ever caught the red ones? My camera, at the time, was not capable of the task but I''ve seen them twice. Never have seen pics of them. Love the colors and detail. Keep up the wonderful photography. Added to the Ten pile :)</td>', 'Another in the "Oh Wow!" category :) Beautiful shot. I''m a huge Northern Lights fan. There isn''t much that''s more awe-inspiring than the display they create. You''ve managed to captured an incredible show here. I have to ask if you''ve ever caught the red ones? My camera, at the time, was not capable of the task but I''ve seen them twice. Never have seen pics of them. Love the colors and detail. Keep up the wonderful photography. Added to the Ten pile :)', '2006-12-16 17:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123917, 438768, 44980, '<td valign="top">Speechless. One of the most dramatic pictures in this challenge best of luck.</td>', 'Speechless. One of the most dramatic pictures in this challenge best of luck.', '2006-12-16 17:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123922, 438136, 67237, '<td valign="top">Spectacular idea &amp; composition</td>', 'Spectacular idea & composition', '2006-12-16 17:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123923, 438620, 44980, '<td valign="top">Stunning. 10</td>', 'Stunning. 10', '2006-12-16 17:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123924, 438545, 44980, '<td valign="top">Fantastic picture one of the best in this challenge. Best of luck</td>', 'Fantastic picture one of the best in this challenge. Best of luck', '2006-12-16 17:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3123938, 437270, 32767, '<td valign="top">Robert-This is one of your best. I enjoy that it''s more realistic than most. It has a peaceful, soothing winter feel and the three circling birds add that tender touch of warmth to it''s cool, sweeping vastness. A great spot, I hope to see it in person one of these days. Cheers!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-23 04:27:35.</i></td>', 'Robert-This is one of your best. I enjoy that it''s more realistic than most. It has a peaceful, soothing winter feel and the three circling birds add that tender touch of warmth to it''s cool, sweeping vastness. A great spot, I hope to see it in person one of these days. Cheers!', '2006-12-16 17:32:52.000000', '2006-12-23 04:27:35.000000', 1),
(3123989, 438525, 35078, '<td valign="top">Incredible!</td>', 'Incredible!', '2006-12-16 17:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124006, 438844, 62095, '<td valign="top">Nice artisitc style. full marks</td>', 'Nice artisitc style. full marks', '2006-12-16 18:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124007, 436271, 62095, '<td valign="top">I almost think that this would be a better image without the hands and person.</td>', 'I almost think that this would be a better image without the hands and person.', '2006-12-16 18:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124036, 437730, 55838, '<td valign="top">I love the simple softness of this shot and the great gradient in the sky. Back to bump you up to 9.</td>', 'I love the simple softness of this shot and the great gradient in the sky. Back to bump you up to 9.', '2006-12-16 18:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124046, 437730, 41337, '<td valign="top">Now that''s more like it. Beautiful simplicity. Adding to favs.</td>', 'Now that''s more like it. Beautiful simplicity. Adding to favs.', '2006-12-16 18:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
