(3124073, 438606, 41337, '<td valign="top">I really wish you hid the sun behind that foreground tree so that it wouldn''t shine through like that. Other than that there is a lot to like about the photo. The branches up in the sky like that is very appealling.</td>', 'I really wish you hid the sun behind that foreground tree so that it wouldn''t shine through like that. Other than that there is a lot to like about the photo. The branches up in the sky like that is very appealling.', '2006-12-16 18:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124079, 436893, 41337, '<td valign="top">Wowy colors.</td>', 'Wowy colors.', '2006-12-16 19:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124081, 438494, 41337, '<td valign="top">In some ways it looks fake and in other ways real. I''m guessing real but regardless it''s a great image. The composition is perfect.</td>', 'In some ways it looks fake and in other ways real. I''m guessing real but regardless it''s a great image. The composition is perfect.', '2006-12-16 19:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
