(3124143, 436459, 41337, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments. I gave your photo a 7 but to be honest I would have probably scored it higher had it not been for the other one like this in the challenge. Your shot while perfectly executed doesn''t have quite the impact the other had emotionally or compositionally. However, having said that I do expect you to either ribbon or come very close. Good luck.</td>', 'Returning for comments. I gave your photo a 7 but to be honest I would have probably scored it higher had it not been for the other one like this in the challenge. Your shot while perfectly executed doesn''t have quite the impact the other had emotionally or compositionally. However, having said that I do expect you to either ribbon or come very close. Good luck.', '2006-12-16 19:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
