(3124202, 438582, 36988, '<td valign="top">Hi... Just a comment or two about your image. The colors are <br/>very dramatic and make a bold statement however I think you might have done a little better if you minimized the ground. It is too intrusive I find and really has no value to the image. Because of the ground I find the overall composition a bit awkward. Mind your sharpening as well as the tree line is a bit out of focus and draws the eye there immediately. <br/>I''m always reluctant to point out what I perceive as flaws... so hope you don''t mind... :)</td>', 'Hi... Just a comment or two about your image. The colors are very dramatic and make a bold statement however I think you might have done a little better if you minimized the ground. It is too intrusive I find and really has no value to the image. Because of the ground I find the overall composition a bit awkward. Mind your sharpening as well as the tree line is a bit out of focus and draws the eye there immediately. I''m always reluctant to point out what I perceive as flaws... so hope you don''t mind... :)', '2006-12-16 20:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
