(3124244, 438757, 36988, '<td valign="top">Outstanding work. For me however, the helicopter is an unnecesary element and transforms this from a heavenly image to an oddly surreal one. Matter of taste really but enough that it took away something from this for me. Good is good and this definately is good... :)</td>', 'Outstanding work. For me however, the helicopter is an unnecesary element and transforms this from a heavenly image to an oddly surreal one. Matter of taste really but enough that it took away something from this for me. Good is good and this definately is good... :)', '2006-12-16 20:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124245, 437571, 36988, '<td valign="top">This image troubles me a bit. It is so obviously a beautiful image and one of the best in the challenge, The tie in to sky is a bit of a reach but I wonder if the drama would be there if not for the richness and crop and placement of the sky itself. I think not so I''ll vote as if the sky is one of the main players, which in the end it is. <br/>A short side note... There is every possibility that there will be some negative feedback about the nature of the young subject and the pose in particular... I hope you accept it with the obvious style and class in which you presented this image. I think it''s wonderful and portrays so perfectly the beauty and innocence of childhood. Man I hope I''m wrong... :)<br/>10</td>', 'This image troubles me a bit. It is so obviously a beautiful image and one of the best in the challenge, The tie in to sky is a bit of a reach but I wonder if the drama would be there if not for the richness and crop and placement of the sky itself. I think not so I''ll vote as if the sky is one of the main players, which in the end it is. A short side note... There is every possibility that there will be some negative feedback about the nature of the young subject and the pose in particular... I hope you accept it with the obvious style and class in which you presented this image. I think it''s wonderful and portrays so perfectly the beauty and innocence of childhood. Man I hope I''m wrong... :)10', '2006-12-16 20:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
