(3124827, 438545, 36988, '<td valign="top">High praise for doing something that is so risky. It''s lovely and worthy of high marks but I fear you will get hit hard by some. Nonetheless, beautifully done.</td>', 'High praise for doing something that is so risky. It''s lovely and worthy of high marks but I fear you will get hit hard by some. Nonetheless, beautifully done.', '2006-12-17 01:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124828, 438812, 36988, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Beautiful colors and crispness and full of personality and imagination. Well done!</td>', 'Very cool. Beautiful colors and crispness and full of personality and imagination. Well done!', '2006-12-17 01:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124832, 438723, 36988, '<td valign="top">A lovely clean crisp image with serenity written all over it. Great job!</td>', 'A lovely clean crisp image with serenity written all over it. Great job!', '2006-12-17 01:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124840, 437881, 36988, '<td valign="top">I liked what you did here alot. Only thought that''s a little negative is that I would have liked to have seen more seperation between the trees and the sky. Perhaps a lighter tone amongst the branches. regardless. Very stylish and unique. Well done!</td>', 'I liked what you did here alot. Only thought that''s a little negative is that I would have liked to have seen more seperation between the trees and the sky. Perhaps a lighter tone amongst the branches. regardless. Very stylish and unique. Well done!', '2006-12-17 01:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124842, 438136, 36988, '<td valign="top">A very nice tribute and you''ve enhanced it some within the new rules. I like this alot and think it should do very well.<br/>Excellent job!</td>', 'A very nice tribute and you''ve enhanced it some within the new rules. I like this alot and think it should do very well.Excellent job!', '2006-12-17 01:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124843, 438620, 36988, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done and so obviously a worthy ribbon contender. Nice job!</td>', 'Beautifully done and so obviously a worthy ribbon contender. Nice job!', '2006-12-17 01:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124845, 436934, 36988, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic and rich in color and mood. the low tree line is a big plus here offseting the sky just enough to show the grandness and the glory. Beautifully done!</td>', 'Very dramatic and rich in color and mood. the low tree line is a big plus here offseting the sky just enough to show the grandness and the glory. Beautifully done!', '2006-12-17 01:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124846, 436835, 36988, '<td valign="top">Beautifully executed and a very unique presentation of a familiar scene. Well done!</td>', 'Beautifully executed and a very unique presentation of a familiar scene. Well done!', '2006-12-17 01:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124847, 438525, 36988, '<td valign="top">I love this image. For me however, I think the overall impact would be a little better with a crop at the shoreline. The beautiful colors and tones seem to conflict a bit with the ''realness'' of the water. More a personal preference I think. Well done!</td>', 'I love this image. For me however, I think the overall impact would be a little better with a crop at the shoreline. The beautiful colors and tones seem to conflict a bit with the ''realness'' of the water. More a personal preference I think. Well done!', '2006-12-17 01:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124849, 438670, 36988, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Great colors and a very neat and fresh feel to this. Nice work!</td>', 'Beautifully done. Great colors and a very neat and fresh feel to this. Nice work!', '2006-12-17 01:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124850, 436692, 36988, '<td valign="top">Very bold, dramatic and powerful. Outstanding job!</td>', 'Very bold, dramatic and powerful. Outstanding job!', '2006-12-17 01:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124852, 437270, 43410, '<td valign="top">this is amazing, one of the few 10s i gave.  this should ribbon.  great job, i''d love to see the original of this.</td>', 'this is amazing, one of the few 10s i gave.  this should ribbon.  great job, i''d love to see the original of this.', '2006-12-17 01:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124853, 436459, 36988, '<td valign="top">I think your world is very cool. Of course there''s going to be some negative voting on this one but for me, it falls nicely within the spirit of the challenge. Nicelty executed.</td>', 'I think your world is very cool. Of course there''s going to be some negative voting on this one but for me, it falls nicely within the spirit of the challenge. Nicelty executed.', '2006-12-17 01:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124854, 437376, 36988, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I fear you may suffer a bit from miscalibrated monitors with this but the effect is breathtaking. Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful. I fear you may suffer a bit from miscalibrated monitors with this but the effect is breathtaking. Well done!', '2006-12-17 01:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124855, 436913, 36988, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and very well pulled off. Just seeing a little grain in the sky but otherwise, very cool!</td>', 'Nice idea and very well pulled off. Just seeing a little grain in the sky but otherwise, very cool!', '2006-12-17 01:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124856, 438532, 36988, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Colors are excellent and I like the crop. Just seeing a few splotches in the lighter part of the sky and might have considered making the tree line a bit darker as I don''t think what''s there is of any importance to the overall image. Nonetheless, beautifull.</td>', 'Nicely done. Colors are excellent and I like the crop. Just seeing a few splotches in the lighter part of the sky and might have considered making the tree line a bit darker as I don''t think what''s there is of any importance to the overall image. Nonetheless, beautifull.', '2006-12-17 01:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124857, 438721, 36988, '<td valign="top">Very nic point of view and the colors are beautiful. Mind your sharpening as I see a halo around the flags. Otherwise, a very bold and dramatic entry. Nice job!</td>', 'Very nic point of view and the colors are beautiful. Mind your sharpening as I see a halo around the flags. Otherwise, a very bold and dramatic entry. Nice job!', '2006-12-17 01:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124859, 437566, 36988, '<td valign="top">Nicely done in many ways however the border is a bit of a problem for me. I see that you are trying to show a nice panoramic view but unfortunatly for me you''ve given up a little drama for width. Would love to see the full size version as I believe it would be quite powerful. :)</td>', 'Nicely done in many ways however the border is a bit of a problem for me. I see that you are trying to show a nice panoramic view but unfortunatly for me you''ve given up a little drama for width. Would love to see the full size version as I believe it would be quite powerful. :)', '2006-12-17 01:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124860, 438797, 36988, '<td valign="top">Simple yet very nice too look at. The colors and tones are excellent. Nice job!</td>', 'Simple yet very nice too look at. The colors and tones are excellent. Nice job!', '2006-12-17 01:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124861, 438572, 36988, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nicely executed. May suffer a bit from miscalibrated monitors however and that unfortunate. :)</td>', 'Great idea and nicely executed. May suffer a bit from miscalibrated monitors however and that unfortunate. :)', '2006-12-17 01:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124862, 436806, 36988, '<td valign="top">It''s really a cool idea but I''m having a hard time figuring out what the added imgage is. I think it''s a thumb but am not sure enough to satisfmy my desire to undestand the image.<br/>Love the choice of color.<br/>:)</td>', 'It''s really a cool idea but I''m having a hard time figuring out what the added imgage is. I think it''s a thumb but am not sure enough to satisfmy my desire to undestand the image.Love the choice of color.:)', '2006-12-17 01:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3124863, 437022, 36988, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Your lights and darks work well together and the point of view is interesting enough to make me want to look just  bit longer. Well done!</td>', 'Beautifully done. Your lights and darks work well together and the point of view is interesting enough to make me want to look just  bit longer. Well done!', '2006-12-17 01:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
