(3125589, 438825, 45524, '<td valign="top">This shot seems very soft on focus and is tilted to the left. Be sure and check your horizons when you shoot or when you post process the shot. And be sure and check your focal point for clarity.</td>', 'This shot seems very soft on focus and is tilted to the left. Be sure and check your horizons when you shoot or when you post process the shot. And be sure and check your focal point for clarity.', '2006-12-17 12:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
