(3125872, 436271, 46782, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Nice job working with the new "Expert" rules. Definitly has the "WOW" factor working for it. Just can''t figure out if it will finish 1st or 2nd:)</td>', 'Very creative. Nice job working with the new "Expert" rules. Definitly has the "WOW" factor working for it. Just can''t figure out if it will finish 1st or 2nd:)', '2006-12-17 14:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
