(3125888, 438825, 62095, '<td valign="top">Maybe you would have benefited (specifically for the sky challenge) from just going outside and shooting the same thing without the Christmas wreath? It''s a nice idea, I think, but it seems to sit in the way of the sky without adding much to the shot, probably because of the lack of focus. You''d have needed a much wider DOF to make it work.</td>', 'Maybe you would have benefited (specifically for the sky challenge) from just going outside and shooting the same thing without the Christmas wreath? It''s a nice idea, I think, but it seems to sit in the way of the sky without adding much to the shot, probably because of the lack of focus. You''d have needed a much wider DOF to make it work.', '2006-12-17 15:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3125889, 438849, 62095, '<td valign="top">Great capture / edit.</td>', 'Great capture / edit.', '2006-12-17 15:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3126008, 438545, 66201, '<td valign="top">This is unbelieveably weird and effective...My favourite for this challenge. 10. What a clever one you are. Reminds me of the illustrations frm "The LIttle Prince". Have GOT To try this tool for effect one day..after I''ve learnt how to do everything else :-)</td>', 'This is unbelieveably weird and effective...My favourite for this challenge. 10. What a clever one you are. Reminds me of the illustrations frm "The LIttle Prince". Have GOT To try this tool for effect one day..after I''ve learnt how to do everything else :-)', '2006-12-17 16:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
