(3126012, 438731, 66201, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity and beauty of this...especially in the way the sky and water are one.</td>', 'Love the simplicity and beauty of this...especially in the way the sky and water are one.', '2006-12-17 16:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
