(3126354, 438668, 56452, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept.   My one criticism is that the contrail on a plane does not come off the tail,  it comes off the engines, so your placement is incorrect.   Most people wont realize this, but I grew up on an airbase.   Great job and near seamless insertion of the planes,  keep up the good work.</td>', 'Excellent concept.   My one criticism is that the contrail on a plane does not come off the tail,  it comes off the engines, so your placement is incorrect.   Most people wont realize this, but I grew up on an airbase.   Great job and near seamless insertion of the planes,  keep up the good work.', '2006-12-17 19:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3126423, 437651, 66348, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot, nice work. Love the colors in the sky.</td>', 'Sweet shot, nice work. Love the colors in the sky.', '2006-12-17 19:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3126426, 438705, 66348, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape shot, really like the reflections in the water. Blown out sky hurts just a bit, but non the less a great shot. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice landscape shot, really like the reflections in the water. Blown out sky hurts just a bit, but non the less a great shot. Nice work.', '2006-12-17 19:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3126428, 438545, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great idea. It almost has the image of like an eye. Really like your thoughts and work here. You took the expert editing to a whole new level. Nice work.</td>', 'Great idea. It almost has the image of like an eye. Really like your thoughts and work here. You took the expert editing to a whole new level. Nice work.', '2006-12-17 19:42:23.000000', NULL, 1);
