(3128833, 437318, 53147, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and composition. As far as I can tell one of the better images in this challenge that didnt need the expert rules. Well done. 8 for now.</td>', 'Lovely colors and composition. As far as I can tell one of the better images in this challenge that didnt need the expert rules. Well done. 8 for now.', '2006-12-18 13:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
