(3128874, 437488, 24454, '<td valign="top">Looking at this photo makes you feel like you are actually IN the scene.  Standing there looking up!  I love the drama of those clouds, and the added touch of that moon!   Very nicely done!</td>', 'Looking at this photo makes you feel like you are actually IN the scene.  Standing there looking up!  I love the drama of those clouds, and the added touch of that moon!   Very nicely done!', '2006-12-18 14:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128880, 436544, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is truly breathtaking!   I love gorgeous pictures of ships anyway, but this one is even the best of the best of them!  And its the pink in the sky and how it reflects in the water that makes this a perfect fit for the sky challenge. . .and a perfect 10 for me!</td>', 'This is truly breathtaking!   I love gorgeous pictures of ships anyway, but this one is even the best of the best of them!  And its the pink in the sky and how it reflects in the water that makes this a perfect fit for the sky challenge. . .and a perfect 10 for me!', '2006-12-18 14:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128881, 437220, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmy!  The detail and sharpness on those birds in such low light is aMAZING!   Fantastic!</td>', 'Ohmy!  The detail and sharpness on those birds in such low light is aMAZING!   Fantastic!', '2006-12-18 14:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128885, 438691, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is SO BEAUTIFUL!!!   It takes my breath away!   It''s the first time I''ve seen an interesting object sticking up into the Northern Lights.  It adds so much interest to an already spectacular scene!   10</td>', 'This is SO BEAUTIFUL!!!   It takes my breath away!   It''s the first time I''ve seen an interesting object sticking up into the Northern Lights.  It adds so much interest to an already spectacular scene!   10', '2006-12-18 14:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
