(3129020, 438843, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness!  I have to say, I am blown away by the phenomenal photos in this challenge.  I''ve given out more 10''s than I think I ever have.  But when this one popped up on my screen. . .it grabbed me the most of any I''ve seen so far.  It''s so simple. . . yet so incredibly dramatic and well done.  The composition.  The moon.  The synchronized wings in flight and flawless detail of those birds make this my #1 favorite in this challenge!   In fact, its the only one I''ve actually picked as a favorite so far!  I wish I could give it a 20 to differentiate it from all the other 10''s I''ve given.   But 10 will have to do :)</td>', 'Ohmygoodness!  I have to say, I am blown away by the phenomenal photos in this challenge.  I''ve given out more 10''s than I think I ever have.  But when this one popped up on my screen. . .it grabbed me the most of any I''ve seen so far.  It''s so simple. . . yet so incredibly dramatic and well done.  The composition.  The moon.  The synchronized wings in flight and flawless detail of those birds make this my #1 favorite in this challenge!   In fact, its the only one I''ve actually picked as a favorite so far!  I wish I could give it a 20 to differentiate it from all the other 10''s I''ve given.   But 10 will have to do :)', '2006-12-18 14:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
