(3137401, 438731, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great concept and composition! But I find the color-noise very distracting (the mottled cyan/magenta stuff). You should try Noise Ninja or Neatimage, although it gets overused a lot, for an image like this it can do wonders. Or you could just convert the image to B&amp;W and pretend the noise is a deliberate grainy effect ;-)</td>', 'Great concept and composition! But I find the color-noise very distracting (the mottled cyan/magenta stuff). You should try Noise Ninja or Neatimage, although it gets overused a lot, for an image like this it can do wonders. Or you could just convert the image to B&W and pretend the noise is a deliberate grainy effect ;-)', '2006-12-20 22:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
