(3139114, 436420, 60846, '<td valign="top">great shot, everyone trys to do this one, and you finally got it. good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'great shot, everyone trys to do this one, and you finally got it. good luck in the challenge!', '2006-12-21 13:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139115, 438844, 60846, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2006-12-21 13:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139120, 438136, 60846, '<td valign="top">nice job</td>', 'nice job', '2006-12-21 13:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139122, 438474, 60846, '<td valign="top">this one looks really good, like something out out of a fairytale</td>', 'this one looks really good, like something out out of a fairytale', '2006-12-21 13:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139125, 438024, 60846, '<td valign="top">i love this one. ive allways wanted to capture a shot like this. great job.</td>', 'i love this one. ive allways wanted to capture a shot like this. great job.', '2006-12-21 13:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139130, 438332, 66524, '<td valign="top">I relly like the photo, but the glare of the first light post really competes with the horizon.  When I squint from a distance, it over powers the composition.  Given the editing latitude, could that have been taken out?</td>', 'I relly like the photo, but the glare of the first light post really competes with the horizon.  When I squint from a distance, it over powers the composition.  Given the editing latitude, could that have been taken out?', '2006-12-21 13:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139152, 437376, 66524, '<td valign="top">Difficult to appreciate the photo because of the reflection,  The shore line cuts the image almost in half and I find I am looking up, then down - never at the whole photo, plus everything converges in the center and I realize I never really did look at the sky.  I really like color contrast of right buildings to the b&amp;w building on the left.</td>', 'Difficult to appreciate the photo because of the reflection,  The shore line cuts the image almost in half and I find I am looking up, then down - never at the whole photo, plus everything converges in the center and I realize I never really did look at the sky.  I really like color contrast of right buildings to the b&w building on the left.', '2006-12-21 13:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139163, 438762, 66524, '<td valign="top">I wanted to dismiss my 1st reaction to your photo to remember that I was hoping for something other than the calendar shots offered in this competition.  That said, I love the interpretation, however it "reads" like a high school textbook.</td>', 'I wanted to dismiss my 1st reaction to your photo to remember that I was hoping for something other than the calendar shots offered in this competition.  That said, I love the interpretation, however it "reads" like a high school textbook.', '2006-12-21 13:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139173, 438578, 66524, '<td valign="top">The first thing I did was tilt my head to the right to see the clouds as a face looking at the mountain ridge...Had that been incorporated in the photograph title it would not have been a distraction.</td>', 'The first thing I did was tilt my head to the right to see the clouds as a face looking at the mountain ridge...Had that been incorporated in the photograph title it would not have been a distraction.', '2006-12-21 13:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139181, 438791, 66524, '<td valign="top">Clever title!  The moon reflection is distracting.</td>', 'Clever title!  The moon reflection is distracting.', '2006-12-21 13:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139187, 437270, 39629, '<td valign="top">this one I love, great colour, composition  8 upped to 10 on 2nd and 3rd,4th etc look</td>', 'this one I love, great colour, composition  8 upped to 10 on 2nd and 3rd,4th etc look', '2006-12-21 13:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139193, 438703, 39629, '<td valign="top">great colour, horizon on a slight tilt though</td>', 'great colour, horizon on a slight tilt though', '2006-12-21 13:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139199, 438840, 66524, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Turner painting! :)</td>', 'Looks like a Turner painting! :)', '2006-12-21 13:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139225, 438670, 66193, '<td valign="top">very nice color.</td>', 'very nice color.', '2006-12-21 13:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139227, 436009, 66524, '<td valign="top">I love your photo.  If you are not familiar, look up the artist Georgio DiChirico.  He is, arguably, the father of surrealism.</td>', 'I love your photo.  If you are not familiar, look up the artist Georgio DiChirico.  He is, arguably, the father of surrealism.', '2006-12-21 13:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139231, 438703, 66193, '<td valign="top">great colors.  should have taken care to straighten the horizon, though. probably the 20th person to tell you that, I guess.</td>', 'great colors.  should have taken care to straighten the horizon, though. probably the 20th person to tell you that, I guess.', '2006-12-21 13:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139232, 437727, 66193, '<td valign="top">i like the color treatment.</td>', 'i like the color treatment.', '2006-12-21 13:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139237, 438136, 66193, '<td valign="top">well done, and very creative</td>', 'well done, and very creative', '2006-12-21 13:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139241, 438757, 66193, '<td valign="top">excellent digital art!  maybe a little too much for me.  Not quite in keeping with the photographic nature (IMO).</td>', 'excellent digital art!  maybe a little too much for me.  Not quite in keeping with the photographic nature (IMO).', '2006-12-21 13:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139247, 438709, 66193, '<td valign="top">beautiful capture!!</td>', 'beautiful capture!!', '2006-12-21 14:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139283, 436420, 66524, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo -  from the first thumbnail view!</td>', 'I really like this photo -  from the first thumbnail view!', '2006-12-21 14:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139406, 436459, 23430, '<td valign="top">What a blowout this shot is. Unreal,and well done.</td>', 'What a blowout this shot is. Unreal,and well done.', '2006-12-21 15:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139407, 437349, 23430, '<td valign="top">I had to go straight to this thumbnail and now I''ll have to vote on it. Looks great.</td>', 'I had to go straight to this thumbnail and now I''ll have to vote on it. Looks great.', '2006-12-21 15:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139408, 438843, 23430, '<td valign="top">Cool, I like it.</td>', 'Cool, I like it.', '2006-12-21 15:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139411, 438545, 23430, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks. Nicely done.</td>', 'One of my top picks. Nicely done.', '2006-12-21 15:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139412, 438737, 23430, '<td valign="top">Creepy and great. Good concept and done well.</td>', 'Creepy and great. Good concept and done well.', '2006-12-21 15:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139416, 438149, 23430, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Very interesting and believable as it''s not over done.</td>', 'I like this one. Very interesting and believable as it''s not over done.', '2006-12-21 15:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139426, 438571, 23430, '<td valign="top">All the elements in this shot are great and put together nicely. The lighting on the girl is great too. My only thing is my viewpoint being looked down on feels slightly awkward.</td>', 'All the elements in this shot are great and put together nicely. The lighting on the girl is great too. My only thing is my viewpoint being looked down on feels slightly awkward.', '2006-12-21 15:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139427, 438731, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great shot here.</td>', 'Great shot here.', '2006-12-21 15:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139432, 438578, 23430, '<td valign="top">Awesome sky. Colurs are great. I like how you didn''t include much of the mountains in this shot.</td>', 'Awesome sky. Colurs are great. I like how you didn''t include much of the mountains in this shot.', '2006-12-21 15:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139441, 437220, 23430, '<td valign="top">I really like the overall colour of this and particularly the gulls. I think this may have been more balanced with the wind thingy to the right more.</td>', 'I really like the overall colour of this and particularly the gulls. I think this may have been more balanced with the wind thingy to the right more.', '2006-12-21 15:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139446, 436271, 23430, '<td valign="top">The guy in the clouds is really well done.</td>', 'The guy in the clouds is really well done.', '2006-12-21 15:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139452, 438761, 23430, '<td valign="top">Pleasant shot of the Northern Lights. Not over processed like some.</td>', 'Pleasant shot of the Northern Lights. Not over processed like some.', '2006-12-21 15:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139454, 438525, 23430, '<td valign="top">Wow awesome sky.</td>', 'Wow awesome sky.', '2006-12-21 15:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139462, 438768, 23430, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Can''t tell how much is real or made up, but it''s well done either way.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Can''t tell how much is real or made up, but it''s well done either way.', '2006-12-21 15:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139841, 438731, 1031, '<td valign="top">This week, the title could be "Ducks at Heathrow" : )</td>', 'This week, the title could be "Ducks at Heathrow" : )', '2006-12-21 17:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139852, 438571, 3032, '<td valign="top">Where photography meets drawing.... Cool stuff!</td>', 'Where photography meets drawing.... Cool stuff!', '2006-12-21 17:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139853, 437690, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not really seeing sky so much as sunlight in this picture.</td>', 'Not really seeing sky so much as sunlight in this picture.', '2006-12-21 17:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139854, 438266, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little bit blah I''m afraid. Not really artfully interesting.</td>', 'A little bit blah I''m afraid. Not really artfully interesting.', '2006-12-21 17:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139856, 438762, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting from a academic point of view. Artistically its kinda blah though</td>', 'Interesting from a academic point of view. Artistically its kinda blah though', '2006-12-21 17:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139859, 438474, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great work. This is what DPC should create a niche for. Want to see more of it.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great work. This is what DPC should create a niche for. Want to see more of it. ', '2006-12-21 17:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139860, 438531, 66515, '<td valign="top">Kinda dakr and the paint effect just doesn''t work with me</td>', 'Kinda dakr and the paint effect just doesn''t work with me', '2006-12-21 17:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139862, 438768, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wow, on Fire!<br/>The reflection makes it extra good.</td>', 'Wow, on Fire!The reflection makes it extra good.', '2006-12-21 17:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139864, 438798, 3032, '<td valign="top">Saturation a bit to the max but I still like it. Nice work.</td>', 'Saturation a bit to the max but I still like it. Nice work.', '2006-12-21 17:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139866, 438149, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice work, thumbs up.</td>', 'Nice work, thumbs up.', '2006-12-21 17:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139867, 436459, 3032, '<td valign="top">It''s a small world. :)<br/></td>', 'It''s a small world. :)', '2006-12-21 17:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139871, 437730, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the peacefullness of this.</td>', 'I like the peacefullness of this.', '2006-12-21 17:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139910, 438340, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool effect</td>', 'Cool effect', '2006-12-21 17:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139914, 438149, 9668, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect! It''s like Escher</td>', 'Very cool effect! It''s like Escher', '2006-12-21 17:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139915, 438721, 9668, '<td valign="top">The sky looks a bit photoshopped, but still looks cool.</td>', 'The sky looks a bit photoshopped, but still looks cool.', '2006-12-21 17:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139981, 437349, 30861, '<td valign="top">Whattya mean "still", Leroy? Nice superman effect LOL. That zipper (?) sticking out of your pants leg weirds me out a little. Technically excellent.</td>', 'Whattya mean "still", Leroy? Nice superman effect LOL. That zipper (?) sticking out of your pants leg weirds me out a little. Technically excellent.', '2006-12-21 18:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139987, 437408, 30861, '<td valign="top">The lack of color behind the tree details is bothering me here. Also I can see a hint of color on the snow edges right fore I wish you''d picked up a little so it was more visible, a grace note as it were. But overall, serene and lovely, beautifully rendered. Arguably less about the sky than it is about the stream, but... The challenge is to make the sky a "key element", and it certainly is that. I am half-expecting the voters to mark down images where the sky is not the main "subject", though. Good luck with this.<br/> <br/>This one is growing on me. Bumping a point. I think it''s really, really sweet.</td>', 'The lack of color behind the tree details is bothering me here. Also I can see a hint of color on the snow edges right fore I wish you''d picked up a little so it was more visible, a grace note as it were. But overall, serene and lovely, beautifully rendered. Arguably less about the sky than it is about the stream, but... The challenge is to make the sky a "key element", and it certainly is that. I am half-expecting the voters to mark down images where the sky is not the main "subject", though. Good luck with this. This one is growing on me. Bumping a point. I think it''s really, really sweet.', '2006-12-21 18:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140008, 438757, 57886, '<td valign="top">uha great work... <br/> <br/>Looking at it for the 4th time, love it... it would probably be great in color also...</td>', 'uha great work...  Looking at it for the 4th time, love it... it would probably be great in color also...', '2006-12-21 18:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140009, 438722, 57886, '<td valign="top">Love the "house" and the sky...</td>', 'Love the "house" and the sky...', '2006-12-21 18:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140024, 438620, 57886, '<td valign="top">Nice how you captured the earth and landscape as well as this beautiful sky :o)</td>', 'Nice how you captured the earth and landscape as well as this beautiful sky :o)', '2006-12-21 18:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140028, 437349, 57886, '<td valign="top">Hehe, my son really likes this one... I agree, it´s "fun" to look at. Good luck...</td>', 'Hehe, my son really likes this one... I agree, it´s "fun" to look at. Good luck...', '2006-12-21 18:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140034, 437393, 57886, '<td valign="top">Great image..</td>', 'Great image..', '2006-12-21 18:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140035, 438571, 53316, '<td valign="top">One of my four favorites.  A great example of using editing to enhance the image without drawing too much attention to the editing itself.  The image is lovely, and all the aspects of it work together to create a wonderful mood/feel.  I think this is my second favorite in the challenge overall and that''s ''cause I''m a sucker for rainbow colors, hehe.  I really love this shot and I hope you do well!</td>', 'One of my four favorites.  A great example of using editing to enhance the image without drawing too much attention to the editing itself.  The image is lovely, and all the aspects of it work together to create a wonderful mood/feel.  I think this is my second favorite in the challenge overall and that''s ''cause I''m a sucker for rainbow colors, hehe.  I really love this shot and I hope you do well!', '2006-12-21 18:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140067, 438698, 53316, '<td valign="top">Looks like your photo got liquified mother-of-pearl spilled on it.  Very beautiful.  I hope that you will explain some of your editing because I am very curious as to how you got this neat gathering of images.  I like that the bottom is very busy.. it gives me a lot to look at - and it does not overwhelm the shot as a whole since it is only at the bottom.</td>', 'Looks like your photo got liquified mother-of-pearl spilled on it.  Very beautiful.  I hope that you will explain some of your editing because I am very curious as to how you got this neat gathering of images.  I like that the bottom is very busy.. it gives me a lot to look at - and it does not overwhelm the shot as a whole since it is only at the bottom.', '2006-12-21 18:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140068, 438779, 53316, '<td valign="top">I wish the background were a bit sharper (it looks like it should be smaller if it is that blurry.. hope that makes sense) but overall I really love the photo and think it is very beautiful and meaningful.</td>', 'I wish the background were a bit sharper (it looks like it should be smaller if it is that blurry.. hope that makes sense) but overall I really love the photo and think it is very beautiful and meaningful.', '2006-12-21 18:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140070, 438583, 53316, '<td valign="top">The composition appeals to me.</td>', 'The composition appeals to me.', '2006-12-21 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140090, 438824, 65468, '<td valign="top">For me this is truely a great capture.  The color in the moon compared to the stark white of the monument and the black of the sky is beautiful.</td>', 'For me this is truely a great capture.  The color in the moon compared to the stark white of the monument and the black of the sky is beautiful.', '2006-12-21 18:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140098, 437270, 65468, '<td valign="top">The blanket feel of the sky is nicely captured in the waters reflection the birds in flight add a nice touch.</td>', 'The blanket feel of the sky is nicely captured in the waters reflection the birds in flight add a nice touch.', '2006-12-21 18:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140105, 438737, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think the editing here may be over the top for some but I am perfectly fine with it.  I think you did a very good job of the editing you did.  I feel like you left just the right amount of "border" around the eye and the iris.  The only thing is that the veins could be a little lighter, to me.  I really feel like they are what is grabbing most of my attention.  However I think maybe with them not as visible the shot would be a bit more.. abstract in a way that might not be good for it.  So I don''t know.  Anyway, good image overall!</td>', 'I think the editing here may be over the top for some but I am perfectly fine with it.  I think you did a very good job of the editing you did.  I feel like you left just the right amount of "border" around the eye and the iris.  The only thing is that the veins could be a little lighter, to me.  I really feel like they are what is grabbing most of my attention.  However I think maybe with them not as visible the shot would be a bit more.. abstract in a way that might not be good for it.  So I don''t know.  Anyway, good image overall!', '2006-12-21 18:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140109, 437690, 53316, '<td valign="top">Well, I wonder if you are getting DNMC comments.  I personally feel like the sky is a very "key" element to this image as it really provides the entire context for the rest of the shot.  I''m bumping you up a point for uniqueness and creativity in interpreting the challenge.</td>', 'Well, I wonder if you are getting DNMC comments.  I personally feel like the sky is a very "key" element to this image as it really provides the entire context for the rest of the shot.  I''m bumping you up a point for uniqueness and creativity in interpreting the challenge.', '2006-12-21 18:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140110, 436482, 65468, '<td valign="top">Dramatic cloud effect hope to read the processing after the vote.</td>', 'Dramatic cloud effect hope to read the processing after the vote.', '2006-12-21 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140111, 438693, 53316, '<td valign="top">My first thought when I saw this was that the shadow around the central oval of sky was going the wrong way - it should be on the inner portion of the border so that it looks more like there is a hole in the head.  But then I realized that it was perfect this way as his head truly is "in" the clouds.  I think this is a great image with a lot of symbolism.</td>', 'My first thought when I saw this was that the shadow around the central oval of sky was going the wrong way - it should be on the inner portion of the border so that it looks more like there is a hole in the head.  But then I realized that it was perfect this way as his head truly is "in" the clouds.  I think this is a great image with a lot of symbolism.', '2006-12-21 18:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140117, 438798, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great border, I really like it.  I love this shot although I do feel like the red is a tad overpowering (I realize high saturation was what you were going for - I just do not feel like the red and the blue balance with each other) and that is what put this shot in my top ten favorites instead of my top four.  Everything is so beautiful here - the sky is lovely as is the vehicle.. I don''t know why but it really just appeals to me.  Great image.</td>', 'Great border, I really like it.  I love this shot although I do feel like the red is a tad overpowering (I realize high saturation was what you were going for - I just do not feel like the red and the blue balance with each other) and that is what put this shot in my top ten favorites instead of my top four.  Everything is so beautiful here - the sky is lovely as is the vehicle.. I don''t know why but it really just appeals to me.  Great image.', '2006-12-21 18:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140118, 438531, 53316, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous composition and colors. It maybe looks a bit too much like a painting but it still is visually appealing.</td>', 'Gorgeous composition and colors. It maybe looks a bit too much like a painting but it still is visually appealing.', '2006-12-21 18:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140120, 437738, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love the curvature of the bottom parts.</td>', 'I love the curvature of the bottom parts.', '2006-12-21 18:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140132, 436271, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like this image but I would have liked even better to see less elements in it. It isn''t that I don''t like this type of editing - I have nothing against the more heavily processed shots in this challenge.  I know that it would totally change what you were going for but it might be neat to see just the girl in the sky all by herself.  That is because I feel you have done SUCH  a great job with the girl (pose, colors, the way it is edited to look very, very real) that I want to keep looking at her, and I just find myself distracted by the hands and the face in the clouds.  I think that the girl is strong enough to hold the image on her own.  Or maybe have the hands or the face in addition to the girl but not both.  In any case, you did a good job with the editing - everything looks very natural.  I am bumping you up a point for the strong technical aspect.</td>', 'I like this image but I would have liked even better to see less elements in it. It isn''t that I don''t like this type of editing - I have nothing against the more heavily processed shots in this challenge.  I know that it would totally change what you were going for but it might be neat to see just the girl in the sky all by herself.  That is because I feel you have done SUCH  a great job with the girl (pose, colors, the way it is edited to look very, very real) that I want to keep looking at her, and I just find myself distracted by the hands and the face in the clouds.  I think that the girl is strong enough to hold the image on her own.  Or maybe have the hands or the face in addition to the girl but not both.  In any case, you did a good job with the editing - everything looks very natural.  I am bumping you up a point for the strong technical aspect.', '2006-12-21 18:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140139, 437881, 65468, '<td valign="top">Striking effects looks like a good attempt to create something that streched the "expert edit" latitudes.</td>', 'Striking effects looks like a good attempt to create something that streched the "expert edit" latitudes.', '2006-12-21 19:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140152, 438723, 65468, '<td valign="top">Beautifull image good use of shadows and reflections</td>', 'Beautifull image good use of shadows and reflections', '2006-12-21 19:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140157, 438703, 65468, '<td valign="top">Nice editing and image creation.  One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice editing and image creation.  One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2006-12-21 19:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140158, 438703, 53316, '<td valign="top">Mmmm... I hope heaven is green.  It''s my favorite color.  Did you know that green is the color that is easiest on the human eye? Doctors in some hospitals changed their surgical scrubs to green for that reason. I think God created plants green and our eyes to love green all in the same moment so that the world could be more beautiful for us.</td>', 'Mmmm... I hope heaven is green.  It''s my favorite color.  Did you know that green is the color that is easiest on the human eye? Doctors in some hospitals changed their surgical scrubs to green for that reason. I think God created plants green and our eyes to love green all in the same moment so that the world could be more beautiful for us.', '2006-12-21 19:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140167, 436934, 65468, '<td valign="top">Good image not sure what is real or editing but well done</td>', 'Good image not sure what is real or editing but well done', '2006-12-21 19:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140170, 438722, 65468, '<td valign="top">Another old building picture that just grabs me</td>', 'Another old building picture that just grabs me', '2006-12-21 19:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140179, 438843, 65468, '<td valign="top">Nice photo great composition, the grray sky really compliments the white of the birds</td>', 'Nice photo great composition, the grray sky really compliments the white of the birds', '2006-12-21 19:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140183, 438705, 65468, '<td valign="top">This is just one great picture.</td>', 'This is just one great picture.', '2006-12-21 19:19:32.000000', NULL, 1);
