(3140659, 436459, 60862, '<td valign="top">I really struggled with this one and the other "in the round" shot, trying to decide how I felt about keeping things "photographic."  I really like both images, but this one still feels more like a photo, albeit a heavily distorted one.  On the other hand, the sky here is merely a bland background, not really a "key" element.  Balancing it all out, I''m giving this a 5.  In a free study with expert rules, I''d probably give this a 7 or 8.</td>', 'I really struggled with this one and the other "in the round" shot, trying to decide how I felt about keeping things "photographic."  I really like both images, but this one still feels more like a photo, albeit a heavily distorted one.  On the other hand, the sky here is merely a bland background, not really a "key" element.  Balancing it all out, I''m giving this a 5.  In a free study with expert rules, I''d probably give this a 7 or 8.', '2006-12-21 22:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140666, 438812, 60862, '<td valign="top">Too much editing, not enough reason for it.  The sky background looks like it''s pretty dramatic, but it''s covered up by the cars.</td>', 'Too much editing, not enough reason for it.  The sky background looks like it''s pretty dramatic, but it''s covered up by the cars.', '2006-12-21 23:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140667, 438698, 60862, '<td valign="top">This just feels like a mishmash of random stuff stuck in front of a sky background.  Just my opinion, of course;  if you like it, be happy. :)</td>', 'This just feels like a mishmash of random stuff stuck in front of a sky background.  Just my opinion, of course;  if you like it, be happy. :)', '2006-12-21 23:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
