(3140670, 437270, 60862, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''m guessing this is Bear_Music.  If not, great job emulating his style! :)  10.</td>', 'Okay, I''m guessing this is Bear_Music.  If not, great job emulating his style! :)  10.', '2006-12-21 23:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140690, 438545, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very nice as a piece of artwork.  But I''m not sure about it as "photo."  One of the things the SC encouraged us to do was to vote down things that didn''t retain a photographic feel.  So I''ve struggled all week with this one and the other entry that uses a round motif.<br/> <br/>This one feels less like a photo to me than the other one, but the sky plays a much more important role here.  I was originally voting a 5, but I''ll bump up a point to 6.  I realize that''s not much, but maybe it''ll make a difference in the final ranking.<br/> <br/>I''d definitely suggest selling this as a really nice piece of art, though!  That''s why I''m adding it to my favorites.</td>', 'Very nice as a piece of artwork.  But I''m not sure about it as "photo."  One of the things the SC encouraged us to do was to vote down things that didn''t retain a photographic feel.  So I''ve struggled all week with this one and the other entry that uses a round motif. This one feels less like a photo to me than the other one, but the sky plays a much more important role here.  I was originally voting a 5, but I''ll bump up a point to 6.  I realize that''s not much, but maybe it''ll make a difference in the final ranking. I''d definitely suggest selling this as a really nice piece of art, though!  That''s why I''m adding it to my favorites.', '2006-12-21 23:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140692, 438525, 60862, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shapes, beautiful exposure and color.  9!</td>', 'Gorgeous shapes, beautiful exposure and color.  9!', '2006-12-21 23:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
