(3141115, 437270, 20168, '<td valign="top">Congrats Robert! The three gulls, and especially the one in the slice of orange gives this photo the dynamism of "sky", not merely the stunning colors. Lovely capture.</td>', 'Congrats Robert! The three gulls, and especially the one in the slice of orange gives this photo the dynamism of "sky", not merely the stunning colors. Lovely capture.', '2006-12-22 02:16:10.000000', NULL, 0),
