(3141133, 438545, 28742, '<td valign="top">Got a 10 from me - I loved this one and timfy''s roundy one also. Great work!</td>', 'Got a 10 from me - I loved this one and timfy''s roundy one also. Great work!', '2006-12-22 02:31:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3141136, 438024, 28742, '<td valign="top">Way to go, SLip! Congrats on a top 20. I gave this a 10 - it''s just awesome.</td>', 'Way to go, SLip! Congrats on a top 20. I gave this a 10 - it''s just awesome.', '2006-12-22 02:35:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3141137, 438703, 60165, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon, personal best and .... wow! I also gave this picture a 10, it is simply stunning.<br/> <br/>Please please please, let the company ask me to go to HQ in Iceland some day :-) I have never been there ...<br/> <br/>I MUST go and see this for myself some day, the Northern Light in Anchorage that I have seen so far is not like this. (Too close to the city?) Or is it because of long exposure times, that you get these relative bright shots?<br/> <br/>Anyway, well deserved, finally a ribbon for you :-)</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon, personal best and .... wow! I also gave this picture a 10, it is simply stunning. Please please please, let the company ask me to go to HQ in Iceland some day :-) I have never been there ... I MUST go and see this for myself some day, the Northern Light in Anchorage that I have seen so far is not like this. (Too close to the city?) Or is it because of long exposure times, that you get these relative bright shots? Anyway, well deserved, finally a ribbon for you :-)', '2006-12-22 02:35:20.000000', NULL, 0),
