(3141197, 437690, 32147, '<td valign="top">Thanks to klstover and Magnus for your comments.  Those two comments alone made it worthwhile.  I appreciate your willingness to look beyond the standard way of thinking.  cheers!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-25 20:58:05.</i></td>', 'Thanks to klstover and Magnus for your comments.  Those two comments alone made it worthwhile.  I appreciate your willingness to look beyond the standard way of thinking.  cheers!', '2006-12-22 03:35:23.000000', '2007-01-25 20:58:05.000000', 0),
