(3141373, 438762, 25787, '<td valign="top">post challenge:  Don''t try this at home.  I used an aluminum coated mylar sheet over my telescope to get the shot.  Photographing the sun is dangerous.  You can burn out your camera sensor or worse, your retina of your eye.</td>', 'post challenge:  Don''t try this at home.  I used an aluminum coated mylar sheet over my telescope to get the shot.  Photographing the sun is dangerous.  You can burn out your camera sensor or worse, your retina of your eye.', '2006-12-22 06:50:54.000000', NULL, 0),
