(3141613, 438024, 35357, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dsterner:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the concept, but I focus more on the buildings.  While the buildings do lead me to the sky, I find the buildings more interesting to look at.  Then I considered a metaphor like skyscaper and scored after considerable time reinterpreting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks, that''s above &amp; beyond the call of voting-duty!  Actually, I wanted to title this <b>"Scraping the Sky"</b>, but thought it might be lame to have the challenge subject in my title.</td>', 'Originally posted by dsterner: I like the concept, but I focus more on the buildings.  While the buildings do lead me to the sky, I find the buildings more interesting to look at.  Then I considered a metaphor like skyscaper and scored after considerable time reinterpreting.  Thanks, that''s above & beyond the call of voting-duty!  Actually, I wanted to title this "Scraping the Sky", but thought it might be lame to have the challenge subject in my title.', '2006-12-22 09:37:36.000000', NULL, 0),
