(3141736, 438768, 38032, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to appreciate this.  The familiarity of the subject is the reason.  <br/> <br/>Now, I look at those stars and I see how magical is feels -  the image makes a connection between ''man'' and the heavens - or ''space'' if you prefer.  <br/> <br/>I think you''re right - tho boat is especially important in this connection and it also allows for an obvious sense of size/scale.  The green and black vignetting in and out along with the stars  gleaming and sharp are especially impressive.  I''m glad the manipulation here is that of a higher source than mere humanity-  so congrats - you certainly have your finger on the pulse of beauty.</td>', 'It took me a while to appreciate this.  The familiarity of the subject is the reason.   Now, I look at those stars and I see how magical is feels -  the image makes a connection between ''man'' and the heavens - or ''space'' if you prefer.   I think you''re right - tho boat is especially important in this connection and it also allows for an obvious sense of size/scale.  The green and black vignetting in and out along with the stars  gleaming and sharp are especially impressive.  I''m glad the manipulation here is that of a higher source than mere humanity-  so congrats - you certainly have your finger on the pulse of beauty.', '2006-12-22 10:23:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3141737, 438798, 24454, '<td valign="top">So GLAD this finished so strong!  I love it when someone''s talent screams from an ordinary scene made exceptional!!!<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a top 15 placing in such an inspiring challenge!<br/> <br/></td>', 'So GLAD this finished so strong!  I love it when someone''s talent screams from an ordinary scene made exceptional!!! Congratulations on a top 15 placing in such an inspiring challenge! ', '2006-12-22 10:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3141745, 437270, 45187, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  The birds really make it for me - brings action into an otherwise perfectly still capture.  Well done R.  Must be that new computer!! :)</td>', 'Excellent shot.  The birds really make it for me - brings action into an otherwise perfectly still capture.  Well done R.  Must be that new computer!! :)', '2006-12-22 10:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
