(3141773, 438798, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice Aussie colours indeed, as said below.  This was one of the most dramatic of the year and of the challenge.  When I was a tiny kid, my parents drove round the outback of Australia twice and the rusty countryside of Broken Hill is familiar to me in a far distant memory.  The corrugated roads and taste of dust in a non-air conditioned car are still with me.  That was back in the 50s.</td>', 'Nice Aussie colours indeed, as said below.  This was one of the most dramatic of the year and of the challenge.  When I was a tiny kid, my parents drove round the outback of Australia twice and the rusty countryside of Broken Hill is familiar to me in a far distant memory.  The corrugated roads and taste of dust in a non-air conditioned car are still with me.  That was back in the 50s.', '2006-12-22 10:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
