(3143352, 437270, 58430, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10.  I really love this shot.  Dramatic sky and wonderful reflection.  I never even thought you had painted in the reflection...it looked natural to me.  I am jealous that this is only minutes away from your house.  For me to get something like this I have to drive at least 45-60 minutes.  You have inspired me to do HDR and tonemapping.  Thanks for your help on PP.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-22 21:18:20.</i></td>', 'I gave this a 10.  I really love this shot.  Dramatic sky and wonderful reflection.  I never even thought you had painted in the reflection...it looked natural to me.  I am jealous that this is only minutes away from your house.  For me to get something like this I have to drive at least 45-60 minutes.  You have inspired me to do HDR and tonemapping.  Thanks for your help on PP.', '2006-12-22 21:17:30.000000', '2006-12-22 21:18:20.000000', 0),
(3143362, 436459, 58430, '<td valign="top">thank you for the instructions on how to do this.  loved your shot...it is inspiring.</td>', 'thank you for the instructions on how to do this.  loved your shot...it is inspiring.', '2006-12-22 21:21:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3143368, 438545, 58430, '<td valign="top">awesome job here.  gave it a 10.  I was just in love with this once I saw it.  The title really adds to it as well.</td>', 'awesome job here.  gave it a 10.  I was just in love with this once I saw it.  The title really adds to it as well.', '2006-12-22 21:23:28.000000', NULL, 0),
