(3144622, 438768, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by metatate:</b></div><hr/><i> I think you''re right - tho boat is especially important in this connection and it also allows for an obvious sense of size/scale. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wow there''s a boat? Very hard to notice that when presented with God''s painting floating in the sky. :P</td>', 'Originally posted by metatate: I think you''re right - tho boat is especially important in this connection and it also allows for an obvious sense of size/scale.   Wow there''s a boat? Very hard to notice that when presented with God''s painting floating in the sky. :P', '2006-12-23 13:52:17.000000', NULL, 0),
