(3146667, 437690, 20608, '<td valign="top">Hello matty, knew this was Japan, thought it might be you, got a 6 from me, surprised to see it rate so low, but, you know what.... DPC voters have a certain style they like and if you go outside that style then you MIGHT get a bomber. Keep doing what YOU like best mate, and good luck.</td>', 'Hello matty, knew this was Japan, thought it might be you, got a 6 from me, surprised to see it rate so low, but, you know what.... DPC voters have a certain style they like and if you go outside that style then you MIGHT get a bomber. Keep doing what YOU like best mate, and good luck.', '2006-12-24 20:09:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3146745, 437408, 70360, '<td valign="top">it is amazingly different with the blue tinge on the snow makes it feel kinda magical and the most amazing sunset</td>', 'it is amazingly different with the blue tinge on the snow makes it feel kinda magical and the most amazing sunset', '2006-12-24 21:34:58.000000', NULL, 0),
