(3152444, 437270, 48560, '<td valign="top">yes Robert, I see what you mean now. This is so good it must have stolen your interest from that other "outtake" shot. This photo seems to flow out towards you! must be those darn clouds again - great work. Those flying birds also adds life to the composition.<br/> <br/>EDIT: I have just only noticed that you bagged a red ribbon with this photo (slaps self for not noticing earlier). Guess you don''t really needed my comment to tell you how good this shot is! Congrats :)<br/> <br/>crayon<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-27 21:03:24.</i></td>', 'yes Robert, I see what you mean now. This is so good it must have stolen your interest from that other "outtake" shot. This photo seems to flow out towards you! must be those darn clouds again - great work. Those flying birds also adds life to the composition. EDIT: I have just only noticed that you bagged a red ribbon with this photo (slaps self for not noticing earlier). Guess you don''t really needed my comment to tell you how good this shot is! Congrats :) crayon', '2006-12-27 04:50:04.000000', '2006-12-27 21:03:24.000000', 0),
